1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:07,120
Go home with me. Hey—let go.
And why didn't you put on proper clothes?

2
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:12,460
- I just took a shower.
- Don't tell me you and him…

3
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:20,119
Are you sure
you didn't do anything to him?

4
00:00:20,119 --> 00:00:25,519
Huh?
Wait, wait, wait—

5
00:00:25,519 --> 00:00:30,599
Me? Passing out and
doing something to my best friend?

6
00:00:30,599 --> 00:00:39,360
Are you crazy?
I don't like guys. And I already have a wife.

7
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:47,000
Use your brain, not your damn feet to think.
Well… it's because he—

8
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:53,320
Wait, what did you do to Earth?

9
00:00:53,320 --> 00:00:57,359
Why does he have to pack his bags like this?

10
00:00:57,760 --> 00:01:02,280
- Earth—Earth, I'm sorry.
- Come back.

11
00:01:02,280 --> 00:01:07,880
- Earth.
- I said go back.

12
00:01:07,880 --> 00:01:14,570
Gun, I think you should leave first.
Yeah, he's not ready to talk.

13
00:01:25,320 --> 00:01:28,217
Get out. I don't want to talk to you.

14
00:01:44,600 --> 00:01:47,858
- Let go.
- No.

15
00:01:48,253 --> 00:01:51,279
I said let go!

16
00:01:51,279 --> 00:01:52,369
I like you, Earth.
